message: "If you use these models, please cite the associated paper and this dataset."
title: "urbs energy-system models for a rural ecotourism lodging (six scenarios)"
abstract: >-
  Distributed-energy-system optimisation models (urbs 1.0.1) for a rural ecotourism
  lodging unit in Singuilucan, Hidalgo, Mexico, covering six scenarios that combine
  two building-envelope configurations (conventional and passive) with three operating
  settings (grid-connected, off-grid and carbon-priced). Supports the paper "Integrated
  Building Energy Simulation and Energy Systems Optimisation Modelling for Low-Carbon
  Design under Uncertain Demand".
type: dataset
